ecision\n- Canonical pause sentinel: `research/.deep-research-pause`\n- Capability matrix: `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/runtime-capabilities.json`\n- Capability matrix doc: `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/guides/capability-matrix.md`\n- Capability resolver: `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/runtime-capabilities.cjs`\n- Current generation: [from config.lineage.generation]\n- Started: [timestamp]\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cat .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-config.json; echo \"---STRATEGY---\"; cat .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-strategy.md","time":{"start":1792429925018,"end":1792429925031}},"id":"prt_1552621fe001xpe6gOmt5SLwD5","sessionID":"ses_eaada65b7ffeHiWlwBKhGghsv7","messageID":"msg_15526114500107VZRaCo5Cx0c8"}}
