{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792430237223,"sessionID":"ses_eaada65b7ffeHiWlwBKhGghsv7","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_05s9fUVrizz6szr8GbMg9477","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -rn \"CLAUDE_PID\" --include=\"*.md\" --include=\"*.json\" --include=\"*.js\" --include=\"*.ts\" --include=\"*.mjs\" --include=\"*.cjs\" . 2>/dev/null | grep -v \"session-relaunch\" | head -20"},"output":"./.skilled/commands/speckit/handoff.md:21:**Inputs:** nothing through `$ARGUMENTS`. Both `prepare` and `claim` require `--session <id>`. Only Claude Code can omit it and use `$CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID`. On Claude, `CLAUDE_PID` supplies the runtime process id for the shell-child check. Other runtimes must pass the session id. If a runtime has no session-id variable, such as Devin or Cursor, run `uuidgen` once and reuse that id for the session. `spec_folder` records the Gate 3 answer: the repo-relative packet path, `none` after D) Skip or empty when Gate 3 was never answered.\n./.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-claude-code/references/integration-patterns.md:168:CLAUDE_PID=$!\n./.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-claude-code/references/integration-patterns.md:173:if kill -0 $CLAUDE_PID 2>/dev/null; then\n./.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-claude-code/references/integration-patterns.md:180:wait $CLAUDE_PID\n","metadata":{"output":"./.skilled/commands/speckit/handoff.md:21:**Inputs:** nothing through `$ARGUMENTS`. Both `prepare` and `claim` require `--session <id>`. Only Claude Code can omit it and use `$CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID`. On Claude, `CLAUDE_PID` supplies the runtime process id for the shell-child check. Other runtimes must pass the session id. If a runtime has no session-id variable, such as Devin or Cursor, run `uuidgen` once and reuse that id for the session. `spec_folder` records the Gate 3 answer: the repo-relative packet path, `none` after D) Skip or empty when Gate 3 was never answered.\n./.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-claude-code/references/integration-patterns.md:168:CLAUDE_PID=$!\n./.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-claude-code/references/integration-patterns.md:173:if kill -0 $CLAUDE_PID 2>/dev/null; then\n./.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-claude-code/references/integration-patterns.md:180:wait $CLAUDE_PID\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"grep -rn \"CLAUDE_PID\" --include=\"*.md\" --include=\"*.json\" --include=\"*.js\" --include=\"*.ts\" --include=\"*.mjs\" --include=\"*.cjs\" . 2>/dev/null | grep -v \"session-relaunch\" | head -20","time":{"start":1792430156267,"end":1792430237222}},"id":"prt_15529a90f00127YM7Krsj6oBFG","sessionID":"ses_eaada65b7ffeHiWlwBKhGghsv7","messageID":"msg_155298ce1001Gk1PmNQSosgdd5"}}
