{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792430843137,"sessionID":"ses_eaada65b7ffeHiWlwBKhGghsv7","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_PrflTJxvcuhBVrCaUSTB3482","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"synthesis\\|convergence\\|stopReason\\|stop_reason\\|run_completed\\|terminal\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-research-ledger-schema/deep-research-ledger-types.ts | head -40"},"output":"121:  readonly convergencePolicyVersion: Version;\n285:  readonly synthesisPolicyDigest: Digest;\n294:  readonly synthesisReceiptRef: string;\n337:// The synthesis report is the last write of a run, so its payload carries the\n347:  readonly stopReason: string;\n365:  readonly stopReason: string;\n369:  readonly terminalStatus: 'blocked' | 'completed' | 'incomplete';\n370:  readonly convergenceEventId: string;\n371:  readonly synthesisEventId: string;\n420:// post-synthesis row carries both, so they are null when the row omits them.\n454:  'deep_research.convergence_evaluated',\n455:  'deep_research.convergence_blocked',\n456:  'deep_research.synthesis_started',\n457:  'deep_research.synthesis_committed',\n461:  'deep_research.run_completed',\n466:  'deep_research.synthesis_incomplete',\n467:  'deep_research.synthesis_complete',\n474:  'deep_research.spec_synthesis_deferred',\n504:  'deep_research.convergence_evaluated': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: convergence is recomputed from flat rows. A convergence step would speak it once the decision is appended rather than inferred.' },\n505:  'deep_research.convergence_blocked': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: blocked convergence is a flat event. A convergence step would speak it once blocker ids and the incomplete reason are appended.' },\n506:  'deep_research.synthesis_started': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: synthesis is a workflow phase. The synthesis step would speak it once the report phase opens with its source range.' },\n507:  'deep_research.synthesis_committed': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: the research report is written as a file. The synthesis step would speak it once the report digest is appended.' },\n511:  'deep_research.run_completed': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: closure is the reducer inference from flat rows. The finalization step would speak it once terminal status and counts are appended.' },\n516:  'deep_research.synthesis_incomplete': { status: 'spoken', producers: ['.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs'] },\n517:  'deep_research.synthesis_complete': { status: 'spoken', producers: ['.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs'] },\n524:  'deep_research.spec_synthesis_deferred': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No workflow stages it: the research workflows write the legacy spec-protocol row, which the append gateway upcasts to this stem. A workflow step would speak it once it stages the stem itself.' },\n543:  'deep_research.convergence_evaluated': 'deep-research.ledger.convergence-evaluated',\n544:  'deep_research.convergence_blocked': 'deep-research.ledger.convergence-blocked',\n545:  'deep_research.synthesis_started': 'deep-research.ledger.synthesis-started',\n546:  'deep_research.synthesis_committed': 'deep-research.ledger.synthesis-committed',\n550:  'deep_research.run_completed': 'deep-research.ledger.run-completed',\n555:  'deep_research.synthesis_incomplete': 'deep-research.ledger.synthesis-incomplete',\n556:  'deep_research.synthesis_complete': 'deep-research.ledger.synthesis-complete',\n563:  'deep_research.spec_synthesis_deferred': 'deep-research.ledger.spec-synthesis-deferred',\n585:  readonly 'deep_research.convergence_evaluated': ConvergenceDecisionData;\n586:  readonly 'deep_research.convergence_blocked': ConvergenceDecisionData;\n587:  readonly 'deep_research.synthesis_started': SynthesisStartedData;\n588:  readonly 'deep_research.synthesis_committed': SynthesisCommittedData;\n592:  readonly 'deep_research.run_completed': RunCompletedData;\n597:  readonly 'deep_research.synthesis_incomplete': SynthesisIncompleteData;\n","metadata":{"output":"121:  readonly convergencePolicyVersion: Version;\n285:  readonly synthesisPolicyDigest: Digest;\n294:  readonly synthesisReceiptRef: string;\n337:// The synthesis report is the last write of a run, so its payload carries the\n347:  readonly stopReason: string;\n365:  readonly stopReason: string;\n369:  readonly terminalStatus: 'blocked' | 'completed' | 'incomplete';\n370:  readonly convergenceEventId: string;\n371:  readonly synthesisEventId: string;\n420:// post-synthesis row carries both, so they are null when the row omits them.\n454:  'deep_research.convergence_evaluated',\n455:  'deep_research.convergence_blocked',\n456:  'deep_research.synthesis_started',\n457:  'deep_research.synthesis_committed',\n461:  'deep_research.run_completed',\n466:  'deep_research.synthesis_incomplete',\n467:  'deep_research.synthesis_complete',\n474:  'deep_research.spec_synthesis_deferred',\n504:  'deep_research.convergence_evaluated': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: convergence is recomputed from flat rows. A convergence step would speak it once the decision is appended rather than inferred.' },\n505:  'deep_research.convergence_blocked': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: blocked convergence is a flat event. A convergence step would speak it once blocker ids and the incomplete reason are appended.' },\n506:  'deep_research.synthesis_started': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: synthesis is a workflow phase. The synthesis step would speak it once the report phase opens with its source range.' },\n507:  'deep_research.synthesis_committed': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: the research report is written as a file. The synthesis step would speak it once the report digest is appended.' },\n511:  'deep_research.run_completed': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No writer emits it today: closure is the reducer inference from flat rows. The finalization step would speak it once terminal status and counts are appended.' },\n516:  'deep_research.synthesis_incomplete': { status: 'spoken', producers: ['.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs'] },\n517:  'deep_research.synthesis_complete': { status: 'spoken', producers: ['.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs'] },\n524:  'deep_research.spec_synthesis_deferred': { status: 'reserved', reason: 'No workflow stages it: the research workflows write the legacy spec-protocol row, which the append gateway upcasts to this stem. A workflow step would speak it once it stages the stem itself.' },\n543:  'deep_research.convergence_evaluated': 'deep-research.ledger.convergence-evaluated',\n544:  'deep_research.convergence_blocked': 'deep-research.ledger.convergence-blocked',\n545:  'deep_research.synthesis_started': 'deep-research.ledger.synthesis-started',\n546:  'deep_research.synthesis_committed': 'deep-research.ledger.synthesis-committed',\n550:  'deep_research.run_completed': 'deep-research.ledger.run-completed',\n555:  'deep_research.synthesis_incomplete': 'deep-research.ledger.synthesis-incomplete',\n556:  'deep_research.synthesis_complete': 'deep-research.ledger.synthesis-complete',\n563:  'deep_research.spec_synthesis_deferred': 'deep-research.ledger.spec-synthesis-deferred',\n585:  readonly 'deep_research.convergence_evaluated': ConvergenceDecisionData;\n586:  readonly 'deep_research.convergence_blocked': ConvergenceDecisionData;\n587:  readonly 'deep_research.synthesis_started': SynthesisStartedData;\n588:  readonly 'deep_research.synthesis_committed': SynthesisCommittedData;\n592:  readonly 'deep_research.run_completed': RunCompletedData;\n597:  readonly 'deep_research.synthesis_incomplete': SynthesisIncompleteData;\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"grep -n \"synthesis\\|convergence\\|stopReason\\|stop_reason\\|run_completed\\|terminal\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-research-ledger-schema/deep-research-ledger-types.ts | head -40","time":{"start":1792430843121,"end":1792430843137}},"id":"prt_155342407001QnPka6AvXzNrBI","sessionID":"ses_eaada65b7ffeHiWlwBKhGghsv7","messageID":"msg_155341457001C80A5yPWVRM6NJ"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792430845784,"sessionID":"ses_eaada65b7ffeHiWlwBKhGghsv7","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01_BWwmrK0tA8eQMtvSLGp32720","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -rn \"maxIterationsReached\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop .skilled/commands/deep 2>/dev/null | head -20"},"output":".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/convergence/divergent-convergence-mode.md:24:`maxIterationsReached`, `blockedStop`, `stuckRecovery`, `minIterationsNotReached`, `error`, `manualStop`, and `userPaused` do not pivot. A pivot failure follows the existing synthesis path.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.5.0.0.md:42:The frozen stop-reason enum contains `converged`, `maxIterationsReached`, `blockedStop`, `stuckRecovery`, `error`, `manualStop` and `userPaused`. Legacy strings are mapped on the fly through a single migration path.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence.md:68:Research pivots are eligible only when the workflow decision is `STOP` and the exact internal reason is `composite_converged` or `all_questions_answered`. The legal-stop and quality gates run before this branch. `maxIterationsReached`, `blockedStop`, `stuckRecovery`, `minIterationsNotReached`, `error`, `manualStop`, and `userPaused` are explicitly excluded. Max iterations, pause or cancellation, manual stop, and unrecoverable error therefore never dispatch a pivot Council.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence.md:83:| `maxIterationsReached` | The loop hit the configured iteration cap |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence.md:98:| `max_iterations_reached` | `maxIterationsReached` |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence.md:110:1. If iteration count >= maxIterations, STOP with maxIterationsReached.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence-signals.md:168:Stop reason: converged | maxIterationsReached | userPaused | stuckRecovery | error\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-recovery/divergent-convergence-mode.md:27:- Objective: Verify `composite_converged` and `all_questions_answered` can pivot in divergent mode, `maxIterationsReached` never pivots, and `off`, `default`, and `sliding-window` remain outside divergent translation.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-recovery/divergent-convergence-mode.md:32:- Expected signals: Exact eligible reasons `composite_converged` and `all_questions_answered`; excluded `maxIterationsReached`; branch predicate requires `convergence_mode == 'divergent'`; successful result binds `next_focus` and proceeds to the loop; adapter requires three native seats and writes pivot-local Council artifacts.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-recovery/divergent-convergence-mode.md:67:PASS if the captured control flow proves eligible legal STOP continuation, `maxIterationsReached` exclusion, and non-divergent mode isolation. FAIL if any required predicate, exclusion, restoration, or continuation edge is absent or contradictory.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:441:Expected signals: Only `composite_converged` and `all_questions_answered` are eligible; `maxIterationsReached` is excluded; successful pivots restore `next_focus` and continue; `off`, `default`, and `sliding-window` cannot enter the divergent branch.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/trustworthy-state-records.vitest.ts:84:    append(log, { type: 'event', event: 'synthesis_complete', totalIterations: 5, stopReason: 'maxIterationsReached' });\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/trustworthy-state-records.vitest.ts:88:    expect(rec.stopReason).toBe('maxIterationsReached');\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/trustworthy-state-records.vitest.ts:166:    append(log, { type: 'event', event: 'maxIterationsReached', run: 5, stopReason: 'maxIterationsReached' });\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/trustworthy-state-records.vitest.ts:169:    expect(rec.event).toBe('maxIterationsReached');\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/fanout-run.vitest.ts:549:  // maxIterationsReached and it leaves research.md on disk. This helper reproduces that exact\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/fanout-run.vitest.ts:561:      { type: 'event', event: 'maxIterationsReached', stopReason: 'maxIterationsReached' },\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/fanout-run.vitest.ts:576:    for (const variant of ['maxIterationsReached', 'max-iterations (10/10)', 'maxIterations', 'max_iterations_reached']) {\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/fanout-run.vitest.ts:604:    expect(violation).toBe('expected stopReason=maxIterationsReached, got converged');\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/fanout-run.vitest.ts:614:    expect(violation).toBe('expected stopReason=maxIterationsReached, got converged');\n","metadata":{"output":".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/convergence/divergent-convergence-mode.md:24:`maxIterationsReached`, `blockedStop`, `stuckRecovery`, `minIterationsNotReached`, `error`, `manualStop`, and `userPaused` do not pivot. A pivot failure follows the existing synthesis path.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.5.0.0.md:42:The frozen stop-reason enum contains `converged`, `maxIterationsReached`, `blockedStop`, `stuckRecovery`, `error`, `manualStop` and `userPaused`. Legacy strings are mapped on the fly through a single migration path.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence.md:68:Research pivots are eligible only when the workflow decision is `STOP` and the exact internal reason is `composite_converged` or `all_questions_answered`. The legal-stop and quality gates run before this branch. `maxIterationsReached`, `blockedStop`, `stuckRecovery`, `minIterationsNotReached`, `error`, `manualStop`, and `userPaused` are explicitly excluded. Max iterations, pause or cancellation, manual stop, and unrecoverable error therefore never dispatch a pivot Council.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence.md:83:| `maxIterationsReached` | The loop hit the configured iteration cap |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence.md:98:| `max_iterations_reached` | `maxIterationsReached` |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence.md:110:1. If iteration count >= maxIterations, STOP with maxIterationsReached.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/convergence/convergence-signals.md:168:Stop reason: converged | maxIterationsReached | userPaused | stuckRecovery | error\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-recovery/divergent-convergence-mode.md:27:- Objective: Verify `composite_converged` and `all_questions_answered` can pivot in divergent mode, `maxIterationsReached` never pivots, and `off`, `default`, and `sliding-window` remain outside divergent translation.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-recovery/divergent-convergence-mode.md:32:- Expected signals: Exact eligible reasons `composite_converged` and `all_questions_answered`; excluded `maxIterationsReached`; branch predicate requires `convergence_mode == 'divergent'`; successful result binds `next_focus` and proceeds to the loop; adapter requires three native seats and writes pivot-local Council artifacts.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/convergence-and-recovery/